<title>USA: Genetic Vectors gets assay patent notice.</title>
<headline>Genetic Vectors gets assay patent notice.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Genetic Vectors Inc said it received a notice of allowance from the U.S. Patent and Trademark Office for a patent covering its company's EpiDNA picogram assay product line.</p>
<p>This application was the second patent for the company's EpiDNA product line.</p>
<p>It covered the &quot;Ring-Opened Purine Compounds for Labeling Polynucleotides&quot;, which were the basic compounds of the Genetic Vectors' core technology, it said.</p>
<p>The company was not immediately available to comment further.</p>
<p>((New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
